    given-names: Sahil
    affiliation: "RBDS AI Lab (Logika)"
  - name: "Logika by RBDS AI Lab"
    city: Dharwad
    country: IN
abstract: >-
  An open, prerequisite-graphed taxonomy of AI literacy for architecture and
  design students (ages 11-22): 287 micro-topics, 614 reasoned prerequisite
  edges, crit-evidenced JUDGMENT nodes, per-topic stance declaration
  (FACTUAL/POSITIONAL) with grounding anchors, and codes-only alignment to the
  UNESCO AI Competency Framework for Students and AI Samarth.
